# Camera Capture (iOS)

Use `camera.photo` for standalone high-quality capture, not `stream.capturePhoto`. Stop Stream first, register Photo publishers, call `photo.start()`, wait for `.started`, then capture. Observe data, progress, and errors; stop Photo before Camera. Requires camera permission and is experimental.
